---
title: Drafts
excerpt: "Local-only drafts."
permalink: /drafts/index.html
layout: layouts/default
route: drafts
statusPath: "~/.drafts/"
noindex: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
css:
  - post-list
---

<div class="ArchiveHead">
  <span class="u">{{ site.profile.handle }}</span><span class="at">@</span><span class="h">{{ site.profile.host }}</span><span class="colon">:</span><span class="p">~/.drafts</span><span class="dollar"> $ </span><span class="cmd">ls -lh</span>
</div>

<h1 class="ArchiveTitle"># drafts</h1>
<div class="ArchiveSubtitle">
  {% if collections.drafts and collections.drafts.length %}
    {{ collections.drafts.length }} draft{% if collections.drafts.length != 1 %}s{% endif %}
    — visible in <code class="t-accent">npm start</code> only, never deployed.
  {% else %}
    no drafts. set <code class="t-accent">draft: true</code> on a post's frontmatter to start one;
    preview it here at <code class="t-accent">/drafts/&lt;slug&gt;/</code>.
  {% endif %}
</div>

{% if collections.drafts and collections.drafts.length %}
<div class="PostList">
  <div class="PostList-Head">
    <span>date</span>
    <span class="right">len</span>
    <span>title / tags</span>
    <span></span>
  </div>
  {% for p in collections.drafts %}
    <a class="PostRow" href="/drafts/{{ p.fileSlug }}/">
      <span class="date">{{ p.date | short_date }}</span>
      <span class="len">{{ p.data.readMin }}min</span>
      <div>
        <div class="title">{{ p.data.title }}</div>
        <div class="tags">
          {% for tg in p.data.tags %}{% if tg != 'posts' and loop.index <= 4 %}
            <span class="TagInline">#{{ tg }}</span>
          {% endif %}{% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="arrow">→</span>
    </a>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="EndMarker">
  <span class="eof">EOF</span>
  <span> — only you can see this list.</span>
</div>
